00:25:55.200 --> 00:25:56.700
We need to clean up as soon as possible.

00:25:57.720 --> 00:25:59.340
Um, Hillary.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:02.400
Is it okay for you to turn right at the next West 34th Street?

00:26:04.080 --> 00:26:07.690
If it's the 7th Street Dome, it's much faster by car.

00:26:07.690 --> 00:26:09.360
Go straight as it is.

00:26:09.770 --> 00:26:11.290
But there's a fog...

00:26:11.290 --> 00:26:17.140
