00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:31.760
Especially the people who call themselves lawyers are the worst.

00:27:33.120 --> 00:27:37.400
I respect you too, Mr. Negotiator.

00:27:39.080 --> 00:27:41.040
There are some rules in this mansion.

00:27:41.220 --> 00:27:42.620
Rituals and justice.

00:27:43.730 --> 00:27:44.750
First, the person who wrote this...

00:27:45.000 --> 00:27:45.920
