00:28:02.220 --> 00:28:03.760
We both use our time efficiently.

00:28:04.480 --> 00:28:05.640
That's true.

00:28:06.460 --> 00:28:11.440
But I have the right to listen to my old mother's wish.

00:28:14.390 --> 00:28:18.390
Did you get a job last night?

00:28:20.430 --> 00:28:24.050
I don't like that type of person.

00:28:24.950 --> 00:28:27.340
