00:28:27.850 --> 00:28:28.770
Melissa Fraser.

00:28:30.030 --> 00:28:32.430
Tomorrow is the 75th birthday of my wife.

00:28:32.830 --> 00:28:34.300
It's a great misfortune to live in East Town.

00:28:35.800 --> 00:28:39.430
All the famous lawyers in this town belong to her farm.

00:28:40.510 --> 00:28:44.870
Now she is a member of the board of directors, but she has a lot of experience in the past.

00:28:45.000 --> 00:28:45.800
You're a bad businessman.

00:28:46.560 --> 00:28:47.140
Norman!

00:28:49.240 --> 00:28:52.330
You've been talking too much about me.

00:28:53.310 --> 00:28:55.340
He's worried about you.

00:28:55.860 --> 00:28:56.300
Don't you know that?

00:28:56.940 --> 00:28:58.910
Of course I do.

00:29:17.852 --> 00:29:18.852
East Town

00:29:19.356 --> 00:29:21.856
Although most of them were made artificially,

00:29:22.332 --> 00:29:24.252
The sun's light falls

00:29:24.476 --> 00:29:27.796
The paradise is full of bright green and smiles.

00:29:29.084 --> 00:29:29.904
Even if it's a lie

00:29:30.668 --> 00:29:33.168
The price to pay to get these is...

00:29:33.260 --> 00:29:34.540
It's extremely effective.

00:29:38.540 --> 00:29:42.000
But knowing that, I accepted this job.

00:29:42.828 --> 00:29:44.288
The reason is simple.

00:29:44.684 --> 00:29:46.924
Women and the elderly are important.

00:29:47.692 --> 00:29:49.692
That's my policy.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.160
Nice to meet you, Mr. Smith.

00:30:02.320 --> 00:30:03.700
Roger is fine, madam.

00:30:04.060 --> 00:30:07.570
I've heard your reputation, Roger.

00:30:08.510 --> 00:30:11.710
You say that you will definitely accomplish the work you have received once.

00:30:12.070 --> 00:30:13.440
Thank you.

00:30:13.880 --> 00:30:20.030
Bonnie, my cute daughter who joined the military police.

00:30:22.290 --> 00:30:22.650
What?

00:30:24.730 --> 00:30:27.850
You were looking at the photo there, weren't you?

00:30:27.950 --> 00:30:28.710
That's right.

00:30:30.700 --> 00:30:36.720
I can feel things that I couldn't see before.

00:30:38.600 --> 00:30:41.550
That's why I asked Rick to call you.

00:30:43.050 --> 00:30:44.840
I love you very much.

00:30:45.000 --> 00:30:46.540
I know that you are a very honest person.

00:30:47.400 --> 00:30:53.050
How was it, Mr. Negotiator?

00:30:53.290 --> 00:30:55.120
Would you like to hear your mother's request?

00:30:56.240 --> 00:30:58.160
Yes, I'll try my best.

00:30:58.340 --> 00:30:59.590
What a man.

00:31:00.760 --> 00:31:02.460
Bring Bonnie to this mansion on your mother's birthday tomorrow.

00:31:04.140 --> 00:31:05.880
That's what you were told, right?

00:31:06.040 --> 00:31:07.100
That's right.

00:31:08.390 --> 00:31:09.670
Bonnie is no longer in this world.

00:31:10.290 --> 00:31:13.580
A year ago, she was shot by a gun, and she sank to the Hadson River.

00:31:14.740 --> 00:31:17.280
But Bonnie's body hasn't risen yet.

00:31:17.930 --> 00:31:19.390
Are you going to take care of her even if you change your body?

00:31:19.550 --> 00:31:24.440
Your mother can't see, so that's the best way.

00:31:25.670 --> 00:31:28.560
I was asked to do a sincere job.

00:31:32.840 --> 00:31:34.000
You little...

00:31:34.000 --> 00:31:41.190
Bonnie was a very kind girl.

00:31:42.560 --> 00:31:45.220
Unlike me and Rick, she had a strong sense of justice.

00:31:45.460 --> 00:31:48.020
That's why she left this mansion.

00:31:49.220 --> 00:31:55.260
She knew what I did and what my status and honor were in this city.

00:32:01.020 --> 00:32:09.640
I don't have a name anymore, so at least once, as a mother, I want to meet that child and talk to him.

00:32:10.940 --> 00:32:12.210
Please, I beg you.

00:32:15.060 --> 00:32:15.760
I remember the case of Bonnie Fraser.

00:32:17.520 --> 00:32:19.980
It was probably a year ago.

00:32:20.060 --> 00:32:25.390
Around this area, there was a fight between the residents of the Dome and the military police.

00:32:26.270 --> 00:32:29.970
The opposition to the expansion of the Dome was a large-scale...

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:32.970
A violent riot took place, but it was suppressed due to a certain incident.

00:32:48.440 --> 00:32:52.860
The death of the young police officer Bonnie, who was killed by a group of radicals,

00:32:52.860 --> 00:32:55.140
became a direct cause for a conflict between the military police and the opposition.

00:33:03.390 --> 00:33:09.450
Melissa buried her sad memory and lost all her memories.

00:33:09.470 --> 00:33:11.370
Just like this town.

00:33:23.800 --> 00:33:25.540
I didn't know you'd negotiate with ghosts.

00:33:27.250 --> 00:33:29.440
The rumor of ghosts in the mist.

00:33:30.800 --> 00:33:35.000
It's said that three officers of the military police were killed.

00:33:35.700 --> 00:33:39.110
Is there any connection between those three and the robbery that took place a year ago?

00:33:40.150 --> 00:33:44.790
The military police is a dog of the Paradigm after all.

00:33:44.790 --> 00:33:48.310
They probably use terrible methods to solve trouble.

00:33:48.750 --> 00:33:50.140
There must be something behind Bonnie's death.

00:33:53.760 --> 00:33:56.100
If you've lived in this town for a long time, you won't misunderstand it.

00:33:57.380 --> 00:33:59.580
But young people like that sometimes.

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:00.980
A person who doesn't know what he's talking about.

00:34:02.500 --> 00:34:03.400
It's fine if it's my guess.

00:34:04.100 --> 00:34:07.060
If you don't want to answer the question, I'll give you another chance.

00:34:07.260 --> 00:34:09.260
Yeah, don't panic.

00:34:10.450 --> 00:34:11.630
It's true that Bonnie grabbed something.

00:34:12.610 --> 00:34:13.940
There's also a rumor that it was erased.

00:34:14.740 --> 00:34:18.010
The executives of the three killed people

00:34:18.010 --> 00:34:20.010
It seems that they were in charge of the land acquisition operation.

00:34:21.310 --> 00:34:24.220
It seems that there is one more person.

00:34:25.390 --> 00:34:26.250
That guy's...

00:34:30.860 --> 00:34:35.750
Captain Anthony Gauss, I heard that you're quite afraid of this ghostly commotion.

00:34:36.310 --> 00:34:45.040
I colored it a little, including your warning.

00:34:47.300 --> 00:34:51.870
I have to teach the elderly to the young people.

00:34:53.470 --> 00:34:58.170
There is no such thing as the sun rising in this town ever again.

00:35:00.960 --> 00:35:01.220
Roger.

00:35:01.320 --> 00:35:09.920
Roger-sama, it seems you'll be coming home late again tonight.

00:35:10.970 --> 00:35:12.290
I'm very enthusiastic about my work.

00:35:13.200 --> 00:35:14.820
We must not be too busy either.

00:35:15.460 --> 00:35:16.860
We won't be having any meals.

00:35:17.540 --> 00:35:19.440
I agree.

00:35:19.760 --> 00:35:21.180
As long as it looks good.

00:35:21.880 --> 00:35:24.560
That's more than enough, I think.

00:35:24.700 --> 00:35:27.900
Tell me where Colonel Rouse is!

00:35:30.120 --> 00:35:33.340
What right do you have to ask such a question?

00:35:34.470 --> 00:35:35.810
Certainly, I don't have such a right.

00:35:37.250 --> 00:35:41.330
Then go home. I'm also very busy these days.

00:35:42.620 --> 00:35:48.890
But, Major Dustin, if you are proud of your job, there is a obligation to answer my question.

00:35:50.660 --> 00:35:52.920
Obligation? What do you mean?

00:35:53.630 --> 00:35:56.440
Bonnie Fraser believed in the justice of the military police.

00:35:57.920 --> 00:35:58.480
Certainly.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:06.710
There is a part of the incident a year ago that is not clear, but it's me.

00:36:06.970 --> 00:36:09.940
What? You lost sight of the company's car?

00:36:10.260 --> 00:36:27.380
The course to go home is different than usual.

00:36:27.520 --> 00:36:29.780
The escort vehicle is missing.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:40.940
Hey, what the hell is going on here?

00:36:41.100 --> 00:36:44.240
The way back is correct, Colonel Gauss.

00:36:44.720 --> 00:36:46.830
Huh? Where?

00:36:47.750 --> 00:36:50.190
Of course you remember, don't you?

00:36:50.190 --> 00:36:52.540
A year ago, I dropped it from here.

00:36:52.880 --> 00:36:54.500
No way!

00:36:54.640 --> 00:36:57.820
The subordinates who knew about this treacherous plot...

00:36:58.220 --> 00:36:59.320
This me...

00:37:00.220 --> 00:37:01.780
The four of you fell from this bridge.

00:37:02.440 --> 00:37:04.990
It's as if you were throwing away trash.

00:37:05.980 --> 00:37:13.930
It was my fault!

00:37:14.680 --> 00:37:15.580
It was my fault!

00:37:16.140 --> 00:37:17.790
You can't apologize.

00:37:18.850 --> 00:37:20.010
I'm already dead.

00:37:21.190 --> 00:37:21.630
What?

00:37:23.040 --> 00:37:26.050
Why don't you show me your proud attitude?

00:37:27.370 --> 00:37:28.330
No, that's...

00:37:28.330 --> 00:37:29.660
The justice I believed in...

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:32.360
That's what you look like!

00:37:32.360 --> 00:37:32.620
You're a pathetic creature!

00:37:33.300 --> 00:37:36.510
S-s-s-save me!

00:37:37.330 --> 00:37:37.850
Fall!

00:38:26.750 --> 00:38:29.200
Shoot, shoot, shoot! Keep shooting until you get to the front!

00:38:41.070 --> 00:38:42.070
So you're saying it's a ghost?

00:38:42.170 --> 00:38:49.280
Yes, it is.

00:39:00.480 --> 00:39:01.460
I'm sure you're ready.

00:39:02.080 --> 00:39:15.720
Mister Ghost, Big O, action!

00:39:48.840 --> 00:39:50.050
My opponent is bad

00:40:01.210 --> 00:40:01.590
It's over.

00:40:01.850 --> 00:40:11.650
Miku!

00:40:11.810 --> 00:40:13.180
It's nothing.

00:40:13.560 --> 00:40:14.560
It's not!

00:40:30.092 --> 00:40:30.732
What?

00:40:59.084 --> 00:40:59.784
What's going on?

00:41:00.480 --> 00:41:00.940
Major!

00:41:05.600 --> 00:41:19.100
The trick of Tejina is the fog he created.

00:41:42.800 --> 00:41:44.370
Major, is it okay if we don't follow him?

00:41:45.130 --> 00:41:50.160
It's okay, Megadeus.

00:41:50.550 --> 00:41:52.050
I don't like him at all.

00:42:04.250 --> 00:42:04.550
Can you tell me one thing?

00:42:05.770 --> 00:42:10.310
Where did you get that robot, Tony Fraser?

00:42:10.670 --> 00:42:17.090
Can I sit down? I'm a little tired.

00:42:22.500 --> 00:42:29.700
About that question...

00:42:30.570 --> 00:42:32.550
Actually, even I don't know much about it.

00:42:32.810 --> 00:42:35.410
That day a year ago...

00:42:36.360 --> 00:42:45.400
You are the leader of the opposition, who started our corruption.

00:42:47.580 --> 00:42:50.160
He taught me everything.

00:42:51.000 --> 00:42:51.560
No way!

00:42:51.640 --> 00:42:53.240
You say he was a ghoul until now?

00:42:53.820 --> 00:42:56.630
A good-natured old man can see the reality.

00:43:00.480 --> 00:43:01.880
It's a pity, but I'll say goodbye.

00:43:02.160 --> 00:43:02.320
Ha!

00:43:07.000 --> 00:43:22.510
Am I allowed to die like this?

00:43:23.970 --> 00:43:26.350
In my faint consciousness, I shouted many times.

00:43:28.010 --> 00:43:28.830
At that time...

00:43:33.770 --> 00:43:34.190
I was saved.

00:43:35.390 --> 00:43:41.740
When I realized, I knew how to control that robot.

00:43:42.320 --> 00:43:46.360
I don't know if it was my own memory or someone else's.

00:43:47.840 --> 00:43:52.420
All I knew was that I had to revenge on them.

00:43:53.100 --> 00:43:55.220
That's all I could think of.

00:43:57.760 --> 00:43:59.640
Actually, I have a wife.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:01.300
I came to see you because you asked me to.

00:44:01.300 --> 00:44:01.520
What?

00:44:01.640 --> 00:44:06.190
Do you remember what day it is today, Mr. Ghost?

00:44:06.550 --> 00:44:09.820
I'm done for today.

00:44:10.040 --> 00:44:13.440
Please leave only two people for dinner.

00:44:13.820 --> 00:44:16.590
My son will come later.

00:44:16.590 --> 00:44:17.850
I understand.

00:44:43.020 --> 00:44:44.900
I thought you'd come back today.

00:44:45.760 --> 00:44:47.230
It's my mother's birthday.

00:44:48.090 --> 00:44:51.380
You're a son who can boast about his father.

00:44:51.560 --> 00:44:53.650
It's a waste for a sinful me.

00:44:55.340 --> 00:44:57.740
I'm proud of my mother, too.

00:45:00.480 --> 00:45:01.340
I love you so much, Mama.

00:45:01.540 --> 00:45:06.100
But promise me one thing.

00:45:08.050 --> 00:45:09.370
You're too kind.

00:45:09.730 --> 00:45:11.980
Don't be used by others and get hurt.

00:45:13.100 --> 00:45:15.980
That's all I'm worried about.

00:45:16.460 --> 00:45:18.250
Yes, I understand.

00:45:35.560 --> 00:45:38.850
You're not going home? Your work should be done by now.

00:45:38.970 --> 00:45:40.000
Can I confirm one thing?

00:45:41.740 --> 00:45:43.410
Confirm? What is it?

00:45:44.530 --> 00:45:46.690
Someday, the sun will rise in this town.

00:45:47.120 --> 00:45:49.060
The young man who believes so is wonderful.

00:45:52.180 --> 00:45:54.080
Hmph. You're going to negotiate with such a top lawyer?

00:46:03.900 --> 00:46:08.950
Don't worry. The trial will be held in a fair way.

00:46:09.130 --> 00:46:09.590
I'll do my best.

00:46:10.290 --> 00:46:13.650
I bet on the justice and pride of the military police.

00:46:16.410 --> 00:46:23.500
I'm counting on you, sir.

00:46:30.830 --> 00:46:31.050
You

00:47:01.560 --> 00:47:05.680
Could you be real?

00:47:06.390 --> 00:47:08.970
My heart says that you're the best

00:47:09.860 --> 00:47:11.700
There's no one else

00:47:11.700 --> 00:47:13.740
You're the only one

00:47:13.740 --> 00:47:17.430
But it's this time

00:47:17.430 --> 00:47:19.150
I lost the river

00:47:22.060 --> 00:47:29.040
And love is such a nice

00:47:32.880 --> 00:47:42.040
Someone we could get to

00:49:01.600 --> 00:49:02.120
What should I do?

00:49:05.850 --> 00:49:08.160
I want to cry out of anxiety.

00:49:08.880 --> 00:49:12.840
Even so,

00:49:12.980 --> 00:49:14.490
here I am.

00:49:16.980 --> 00:49:18.280
I remember these days.

00:49:18.280 --> 00:49:20.240
The day I first saw Zack.

00:49:20.540 --> 00:49:22.120
I couldn't stop.

00:49:24.600 --> 00:49:25.520
Mobile Suit Gundam

00:49:25.890 --> 00:49:26.810
0080

00:49:26.810 --> 00:49:27.250
Bernie

00:49:28.110 --> 00:49:28.900
Don't forget.

00:49:32.200 --> 00:49:35.880
Throwing away the darkness of the darkness, let's go to the battlefield of the great sky!

00:49:35.960 --> 00:49:41.530
Under the flag of the glorious Zeon, Mobile Suit Gundam 0083!

00:49:41.890 --> 00:49:44.360
Tromoy, I have returned!
